rement-to-design transition\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"功能设计\"<|>\"安全防护设计\"<|>\"Security measures are integrated into the functional design phase, ensuring that protection mechanisms are aligned with system architecture.\"<|>\"security integration, system design\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"功能设计\"<|>\"灾备设计\"<|>\"Disaster recovery design is conducted in parallel with functional design, adapting to the project’s architectural structure and operational needs.\"<|>\"system resilience, design coordination\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"功能设计\"<|>\"可视化设计\"<|>\"Visual interface design is driven directly by functional requirements, shaping how users interact with the system.\"<|>\"user interface, functional alignment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"数据库设计\"<|>\"数据字典或数据库设计说明书\"<|>\"The database design process produces a comprehensive document that includes the data dictionary, table structures, and business mappings.\"<|>\"documentation, data modeling\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网公司电网数字化系统\"<|>\"灾备设计\"<|>\"The project's disaster recovery design must comply with the established requirements and current state of the State Grid Corporation’s digital grid system.\"<|>\"compliance, standard alignment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分部\"<|>\"需求调研\"<|>\"The division participates directly in the requirement gathering process through on-site surveys and coordination meetings.\"<|>\"stakeholder involvement, collaboration\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"software development lifecycle, requirement management, system design, database design, security architecture, disaster recovery, user validation\")<|COMPLETE|>"
