t of the current shared storage.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物理数据库服务器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Two physical database servers are being added to deploy the model image node database and enable real-time full-network synchronization with the main model node of Guofen Cloud.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"现有磁盘阵列\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The existing disk array is currently shared between the virtualization platform and database systems; after the upgrade, it will be repurposed solely for database storage.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"模型镜像节点数据服务\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Model image node data service refers to the deployment and operation of services related to model image data handling within the virtualized environment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"本地应用资源需求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Local application resource demand refers to computing resources required for running applications locally within the Southwest site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"全网模型实时同步\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Full-network model real-time synchronization is the capability of synchronizing model data across the entire Guofen Cloud network in real time.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"全局负载均衡\"<|>\"The global load balancing equipment is deployed at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site to enable cross-site application and service distribution.\" <|>\"infrastructure deployment, load balancing\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"高速同步网路由器\"<|>\"The high-speed synchronization network router is integrated into the Southwest Site’s infrastructure to establish a redundant, high-speed resource synchronization network.\" <|>\"network redundancy, data synchronization\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"源端接入交换机\"<|>\"Source access switches are installed at the Southwest Site to create dedicated network zones for model and operational data sources.\" <|>\"network segmentation, data source isolation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器\"<|>\"Six virtualization computing servers are added to the Southwest Site to support both model image services and local application needs.\" <|>\"virtualization, computing capacity\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"混合磁盘阵列\"<|>\"The new hybrid disk array is deployed at the Southwest Site to provide exclusive storage for the virtualization platform.\" <|>\"dedicated storage, virtualization support\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"物理数据库服务器\"<|>\"Two physical database servers are added to the Southwest Site to host the model image node database and enable real-time synchronization with the main model node.\" <|>\"database deployment, real-time sync\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"混合磁盘阵列\"<|>\"现有磁盘阵列\"<|>\"The existing disk array is being repurposed from shared use to serve only as a centralized database storage pool after migration of virtualization storage to the new hybrid array.\" <|>\"storage reassignment, resource optimization\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器\"<|>\"模型镜像节点数据服务\"<|>\"Three of the six virtualization computing servers are specifically assigned to support model image node data services.\" <|>\"resource allocation, service deployment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器\"<|>\"本地应用资源需求\"<|>\"The other three virtualization computing servers are designated to meet local application resource demands at the Southwest Site.\" <|>\"resource allocation, local processing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"物理数据库服务器\"<|>\"全网模型实时同步\"<|>\"The two physical database servers are essential for enabling real-time synchronization of model data across the entire Guofen Cloud network.\" <|>\"real-time synchronization, database function\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"调控云国分云平台及其应用建设规划方案讨论会会议纪要\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"The meeting minutes detail the technical specifications and planned upgrades for the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site based on current conditions and requirements.\" <|>\"planning documentation, site-specific development\"<|>10)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"cloud platform expansion, virtualization, data synchronization, infrastructure upgrade, database deployment\")<|COMPLETE|>"
