f the Guangming Large Model for intelligent review of critical project documentation, which directly supports the necessity of the project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目档案合规智能审查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This refers to the core function of the project, involving the intelligent examination of maintenance and renovation project archives for content accuracy, completeness, and logical consistency using AI technologies such as NLP and knowledge graphs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目里程碑信息报前审查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This is a functional requirement within the project that enables pre-review of milestone data before submission to PMS3.0, ensuring data integrity, correctness, and timeliness through AI-based checks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目档案填报提醒\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This feature involves automated alerts for project document submission deadlines based on milestone schedules, helping prevent delays in archival processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目档案自动上传\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This functionality allows automatically uploading reviewed project documents to PMS3.0 according to predefined rules, reducing manual re-entry and operational errors.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业务智能问答\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This is a proposed capability enabling users to query compliance issues throughout the project lifecycle, receiving AI-generated warnings or remediation suggestions based on stored knowledge.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Southwest Branch is the initiating and implementing organization for this project, responsible for its planning, development, and execution.\"<|>\"project sponsorship, organizational leadership\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"光明大模型\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"The Guangming Large Model serves as the foundational AI technology enabling the intelligent review functions of this project, particularly in document analysis and compliance checking.\"<|>\"core technology, enabling platform\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网人工智能平台\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"The project requires integration with the State Grid AI Platform to leverage existing AI services such as OCR, NLP, and document parsing, supporting the intelligent review workflow.\"<|>\"system integration, technological dependency\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"PMS3.0\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"The project aims to automate the upload of reviewed documents to PMS3.0 and perform pre-submission validation of milestone data, indicating a direct integration need between the two systems.\"<|>\"data integration, system interface\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"《国家电网有限公司关于印发2025 年设备管理工作要点的通知》（国家电网设备〔2025〕86 号）\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"This official directive mandates the use of large models for intelligent review of project documents, providing the primary policy justification for the project’s initiation.\"<|>\"regulatory mandate, policy driver\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"《国网数字化部关于印发人工智能大模型应用规范要求（试行）的通知》（数字技术〔2025〕6 号）\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"This regulation establishes guidelines for large model usage across the company, requiring subsidiaries like the Southwest Branch to build customized AI applications, directly supporting the project’s technical and strategic framework.\"<|>\"compliance requirement, implementation guideline\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目档案合规智能审查\"<|>\"光明大模型\"<|>\"The Guangming Large Model powers the intelligent review function by enabling content matching, completeness checks, and logical consistency analysis using NLP and knowledge graph technologies.\"<|>\"AI-powered analysis, intelligent inspection\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"项目里程碑信息报前审查\"<|>\"PMS3.0\"<|>\"The pre-review function ensures data quality before submission to PMS3.0 by validating completeness, correctness, and timeliness, thus improving source data integrity.\"<|>\"data validation, pre-submission control\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"