    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"National Grid Company Southwest Division is the organization responsible for overseeing the production, technical renovation, and major repair project archive compliance intelligent review micro-application system. It provides an efficient, accurate, and convenient intelligent method for checking project document standardization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"短信平台\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The SMS Platform is one of the data sources integrated into the system, providing SMS interface services through service integration.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"统一权限\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Unified Permissions system is integrated via service integration, providing unified login functionality to support access control and user authentication.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"人工智能平台\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The AI Platform, specifically referred to as 'GuoGong Company Artificial Intelligence Platform', serves as a core component providing intelligent services such as model management, knowledge base operations, and API access for large models.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"PMS3.0\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"PMS3.0 is a system used for project management and data reporting, to which compliant project archive files are automatically uploaded after review.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"光明大模型\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Guangming Large Model is a large language model used within the system for tasks including question understanding, knowledge retrieval, answer generation, and evaluation in business intelligence applications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Vue\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"Vue is a frontend framework used to build the interactive user interface of the application.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"NaiveUI\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"NaiveUI is a UI component library used in conjunction with Vue to implement visual interactions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"TypeScript\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"TypeScript is a programming language used to ensure type safety and improve development efficiency in the frontend layer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Node.js\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"Node.js is a runtime environment used for dynamic rendering of page elements and data processing in the frontend.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"MybatisFlex\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"MybatisFlex is an ORM framework used to simplify operations on relational databases like MySQL.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Elasticsearch\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"Elasticsearch is a search engine that supports full-text search and complex queries, particularly for knowledge base retrieval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"MySQL\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"MySQL is a relational database used to store structured business data.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Redis\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"Redis is a caching system used to store frequently accessed content to improve response speed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"MiniO\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"MiniO is a storage system used for managing unstructured files such as images and documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"Infinity\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"Infinity is a vector database used to store and retrieve vectorized data required by large models.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"OCR\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"OCR (Optical Character Recognition) is a technology used to extract text from images within documents.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"RAG\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) is a technique used to enhance large language models with external knowledge retrieval.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"RAGFlow\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"RAGFlow is a tool enabling workflow orchestration and integration with RAG for enhanced knowledge-based reasoning.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"RPA\"<|>\"technology\"<|>\"RPA (Robotic Process Automation) is used to automate file uploads to PMS3.0 based on predefined rules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西安数据中心管理信息大区\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Xi'an Data Center Management Information Zone is the physical location where the system is deployed, ensuring secure and controlled access to critical infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技改大修项目档案合规智