d analysis tasks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"向量数据库\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Vector Database is a core component responsible for storing and retrieving vector representations of data for semantic matching and efficient search.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"特征提取与分析\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Feature Extraction and Analysis involves identifying key elements from contracts and documents, converting them into machine-readable formats for further processing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数据处理\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Data Processing includes steps such as metadata tagging, question-answer pair annotation, document chunking, table extraction, and image processing to prepare input for intelligent analysis.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"规则清单\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Rule List contains the standards and criteria used for checking document compliance, including content match, completeness, and logical consistency.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"日志模块\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Log Module records user actions and system events for audit and troubleshooting purposes.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用\"<|>\"The National Grid Company Southwest Division is the organizational entity responsible for developing and deploying the intelligent review micro-application.\" <|>\"system ownership, project oversight\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用\"<|>\"短信平台\"<|>\"The micro-application integrates data from the SMS Platform via service integration to enable bidirectional data transmission.\" <|>\"data integration, service connectivity\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用\"<|>\"统一权限\"<|>\"The micro-application uses the Unified Permissions system for role-based access control and authentication, ensuring secure user access.\" <|>\"access control, identity management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用\"<|>\"人工智能平台\"<|>\"The micro-application relies on the AI Platform for advanced capabilities such as model inference, knowledge base management, and API services.\" <|>\"AI de