erating system licenses are assigned to critical servers including database and model image servers at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site.\"<|>\"operating system deployment, software licensing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"数据库及数据库同步软件\"<|>\"Database and synchronization software is used to maintain data consistency between core and mirror nodes at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site.\"<|>\"data synchronization, database management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"多路径软件\"<|>\"Multipath software is deployed on database servers to enhance storage reliability and failover capability at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site.\"<|>\"storage redundancy, fault tolerance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"Public resource software is specifically configured and deployed at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site to provide foundational services.\"<|>\"software deployment, service provision\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"模型镜像节点数据服务软件\"<|>\"Model mirror node data service software is deployed exclusively at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site to deliver model data and related services.\"<|>\"service deployment, data service provision\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"服务总线\"<|>\"The service bus is a core component of the public resource software suite, enabling internal and wide-area service communication.\"<|>\"software component integration\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"消息总线\"<|>\"The message bus is part of the public resource software, supporting event-driven messaging across the system.\"<|>\"software component integration\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"广域服务代理\"<|>\"The wide-area service proxy is included in the public resource software to enable secure inter-site service access.\"<|>\"software component integration\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"权限管理\"<|>\"Permission management is integrated into the public resource software suite to provide unified access control.\"<|>\"softw