ion (GR201651000368) to the China Power Engineering Consulting Group Southwest Electric Power Design Institute Co., Ltd.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"成都海关\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Chengdu Customs issued the import-export goods consignor/consignee customs registration certificate to the China Power Engineering Consulting Group Southwest Electric Power Design Institute Co., Ltd.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"中国电力工程顾问集团西南电力设计院有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"China Power Engineering Consulting Group Southwest Electric Power Design Institute Co., Ltd. is a key technical organization that holds multiple national-level certifications, including comprehensive engineering design and surveying qualifications, and is involved in major infrastructure projects such as the State Grid Southwest Division Control Cloud project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网西南分部调控云国分云西南站点模型数据镜像节点建设及基础平台资源扩容改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A project initiated by the State Grid Southwest Branch Control Cloud to build a data mirror node and expand basic platform resources at the Southwest site, with the China Power Engineering Consulting Group Southwest Electric Power Design Institute Co., Ltd. serving as the preparatory unit.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"刘玥伶\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Liu Yueling is listed as the preparer of the feasibility study report for the State Grid Southwest Division Control Cloud project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全Ⅲ区\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Security Zone III is a designated network security zone where the control cloud southwest site is deployed, with specific hardware and software configurations for secure operations and data protection.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟化服务器12台\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Virtualized servers are part of the hardware infrastructure used in the control cloud southwest site, supporting cloud computing services.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"云管理平台服务器3台\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Cloud management platform servers are critical components within the control cloud southwest site, managing virtualization and resource allocation.\")##\n(