    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国网西南分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"国网西南分部 is a regional branch of State Grid Corporation responsible for power regulation and grid management in the southwest region of China, overseeing various technical and operational projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度运行处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Dispatching Operation Division is a department within the State Grid Southwest Branch focused on dispatching operations and related business standardization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度计划处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Dispatching Planning Department is a division responsible for scheduling plans, risk control, and load forecasting within the State Grid Southwest Branch.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"内水电及新能源处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Internal Hydropower and New Energy Division handles monitoring, evaluation, and management of new energy power generation and hydropower integration in the southwest grid.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"系统运行处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The System Operation Division manages system-level operations, including monitoring and analysis of new energy storage and adjustable loads.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"继电保护处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Relay Protection Department is responsible for relay protection systems, including parameter calibration, online monitoring, and visualization applications.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自动化处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Automation Department oversees automation systems in power dispatching, including server upgrades, data monitoring, and digital display systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"网络安全处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Cybersecurity Department manages network security systems, including CSM application upgrades and multi-level blocking mechanisms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"综合处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The General Affairs Department handles comprehensive management tasks, including grid coordination system upgrades and safety supervision platforms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技改\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Production Technical Renovation refers to a category of projects involving technical upgrades and improvements in production systems within the State Grid Southwest Branch.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"基于云平台的调控运行业务规范化及辅助管理功能建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project involves building standardized and auxiliary management functions for dispatching operations based on a cloud platform, aiming to improve operational efficiency and consistency.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"负荷预测数据管理及评估分析系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This event refers to the development and implementation of a system for managing load prediction data and conducting assessment analyses within the dispatching planning process.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"全周期多目标多约束调度计划风险管控平台建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project focuses on constructing a platform for managing risks in scheduling plans across multiple objectives and constraints throughout the entire cycle.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西南电力调峰辅助服务市场技术支撑系统功能改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This initiative involves upgrading technical support systems for the peak regulation auxiliary service market in Southwest China.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西南电网新能源功率预测及运行消纳监测考评系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project aims to build a system for forecasting renewable energy output and monitoring its integration and consumption in the Southwest power grid.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新型储能及可调节负荷监祝分析系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This event refers to the construction of a system for monitoring and analyzing new energy storage and adjustable load capabilities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"面向新一代调控系统的继电保护定值参数在线校核预警系统改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project involves upgrading an online verification and early warning system for relay protection setting parameters in next-generation control systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"继电保护设备在线监测国分互联及可视化应用提升改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project enhances the online monitoring of relay protection equipment and improves its interconnection with national and provincial systems, along with visualization features.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"风光储接入调度主站技术支撑系统功能改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This event involves upgrading technical support systems for integrating wind, solar, and storage resources into the main dispatching station.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心二楼电子沙盘显示大屏改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project involves upgrading the electronic sand table display screen located on the second floor of the dispatching center.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力调度控制中心调度自动化系统核心服务器改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project focuses on upgrading the core servers of the dispatching automation system in the power dispatch control center.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云电网运行关键指标后评估系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This event refers to the construction of a post-assessment system for key performance indicators of power grid operations using the control cloud.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"基于电碳协同的电网低碳调度分析能力提升改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project aims to enhance low-carbon dispatching analysis capabilities through the coordination of electricity and carbon data.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"攀西电网密集通道三维全景监视分析沙盘系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This initiative involves building a 3D panoramic monitoring and analysis system for dense transmission corridors in the Panxi region.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云国分云西南站点模型镜像节点建设及基础平台资源扩容改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project includes building a model mirror node for the Southwest site on the control cloud and expanding basic platform resources.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云调度运行多维度会商系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project involves developing a multi-dimensional collaboration system for dispatching operations on the control cloud.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心网络安全管理（CSM）应用改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This event refers to the upgrade of the CSM (Cybersecurity Management) application for the dispatching center's network security.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"监控系统网络安全多级阻断及安全三区数据接口风险监测功能改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This project involves enhancing multi-level blocking and risk monitoring for data interfaces in the secure three-zone network system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度控制中心电网调控安全监督平台应用升级改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This event refers to upgrading the application of the safety supervision platform for grid dispat