hip\"<|>\"Nexon Technologies\"<|>\"Global Tech Index\"<|>\"Nexon Technologies' stock decline contributed to the overall drop in the Global Tech Index.\"<|>\"company impact, index movement\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Gold Futures\"<|>\"Market Selloff\"<|>\"Gold prices rose as investors sought safe-haven assets during the market selloff.\"<|>\"market reaction, safe-haven investment\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Federal Reserve Policy Announcement\"<|>\"Market Selloff\"<|>\"Speculation over Federal Reserve policy changes contributed to market volatility and investor selloff.\"<|>\"interest rate impact, financial regulation\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"market downturn, investor sentiment, commodities, Federal Reserve, stock performance\")<|COMPLETE|>\n#############################\n\n#############################\n---Real Data---\n######################\nEntity_types: [organization,person,geo,event,category]\nText:\n<table>\n<tr><td  >颁发单位</td><td  >中国住房和城乡建设部</td><td  >中国住房和城乡建设部</td><td  >国家质量监督检验检疫</td><td></td><td></td><td  >中华人民共和国水利部</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td  >中国住房和城乡建设部</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td  >国家测绘局</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td  >中国水土保持协会</td><td></td><td  >中国工程咨询协会</td><td  >甲190151440174中国住房和城乡建设部</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td  >总局</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td  >成都海关</td><td></td><td  >GR201651000368四川省科学技术厅</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td  >证书编号</td><td  >A151001121</td><td  >B151001121</td><td  >TS1810388-2020</td><td  >甲测资字</td><td  >5100404</td><td  >水文证甲字第</td><td  >231306号</td><td  >水保方案（川） 字第0087号</td><td></td><td  >91510100768614 747H-18ZYJ18</td><td></td><td></td><td  >510191832A</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td  >E151006315</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td  >证书名称</td><td 