    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"The Guofen Cloud Southwest Site is a regional node within the Guofen Cloud platform, responsible for model data mirror node construction and deployment of specific hardware and software components.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云平台\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Regulation Cloud Platform is a centralized system that manages and coordinates cloud services across national, provincial, municipal, and county-level dispatching systems, enabling data synchronization and service delivery through standardized PaaS and SaaS layers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"《调控云国分云平台及其应用建设规划方案讨论会会议纪要》\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This meeting minutes document outlines the planned configuration and implementation strategy for the Guofen Cloud platform and its applications, including the typical configuration for the Southwest site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"模型镜像服务器\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Model image servers are physical servers used to host and manage replicated model data for the Guofen Cloud platform, supporting virtualization and data synchronization across sites.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"本地应用服务器\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Local application servers are physical servers deployed to support local application functions within the Guofen Cloud platform, part of the infrastructure for the Southwest site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数据库服务器\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Database servers are physical servers dedicated to storing and managing structured data, with specific configurations required for high availability and replication in the Guofen Cloud environment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"磁盘阵列\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A disk array is a storage system providing consolidated data storage with redundancy and performance optimization, used in the current phase of hardware setup at the Guofen Cloud Southwest site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"SAN交换机\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"SAN switches are network devices used to connect storage devices and servers in a Storage Area Network (SAN), facilitating high-speed data transfer between components in the Guofen Cloud infrastructure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"源端接入交换机\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Source-end access switches are network devices used to connect source systems or endpoints to the Guofen Cloud network, enabling data input into the platform.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"高速资源同步网路由器\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"High-speed resource synchronization network routers are specialized networking devices designed to enable fast and reliable data synchronization across distributed nodes in the Guofen Cloud system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"管理网交换机\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Management network switches are network devices used to manage and monitor the operational status of servers and other infrastructure components within the Guofen Cloud platform.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟化接入交换机\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Virtualization access switches are network devices that support virtual machine traffic and integration with virtualized computing environments in the Guofen Cloud platform.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"全局负载均衡设备\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Global load balancing devices distribute incoming network traffic across multiple servers to ensure high availability and optimal performance of services in the Guofen Cloud platform.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"计算虚拟化\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Computational virtualization refers to the technology enabling the creation and management of virtual machines on physical servers, with 24 licenses allocated for this purpose in the current phase.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"云管理平台授权\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Cloud management platform licenses are software entitlements allowing control and orchestration of cloud resources, with 24 units allocated for the Guofen Cloud Southwest site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟机操作系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Virtual machine operating systems are software environments installed on virtual machines, with 60 units required to support the virtualization of 6 physical servers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物理机操作系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Physical machine operating systems are operating systems installed directly on physical servers, with 2 units required for database servers and model image/locally hosted application servers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数据库及数据库同步软件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Database and database synchronization software enables data consistency across core and mirror nodes using features like archival log replication.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"多路径软件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Multipath software ensures high availability and fault tolerance by enabling multiple physical paths between servers and storage devices, used specifically for database servers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Public resource software is a suite of foundational services including service bus, message bus, wide-area service proxy, permission management, task scheduling, system logging, real-time alerts, and basic services, all dedicated to the Guofen Cloud Southwest site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"模型镜像节点数据服务软件\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Model mirror node data service software provides specialized functions such as public model service, primary and secondary model data services, statistical services, display services, and interactive services, deployed exclusively at the mirror node.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"服务总线\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Service bus is a middleware component that enables communication between distributed services, offering both internal and wide-area service invocation capabilities with support for registration, monitoring, and clustering.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"消息总线\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Message bus facilitates event-driven messaging across the system, supporting both internal and wide-area communication with features like publishing, subscribing, and message ordering.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"广域服务代理\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Wide-area service proxy enables secure and efficient cross-site service access by routing requests through a cluster of entry and exit proxies, enhancing security and transparency.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"权限管理\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Permission manage