f the Guangming Large Model for intelligent review of critical project documentation, which directly supports the necessity of the project.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目档案合规智能审查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This refers to the core function of the project, involving the intelligent examination of maintenance and renovation project archives for content accuracy, completeness, and logical consistency using AI technologies such as NLP and knowledge graphs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目里程碑信息报前审查\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This is a functional requirement within the project that enables pre-review of milestone data before submission to PMS3.0, ensuring data integrity, correctness, and timeliness through AI-based checks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目档案填报提醒\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This feature involves automated alerts for project document submission deadlines based on milestone schedules, helping prevent delays in archival processes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"项目档案自动上传\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This functionality allows automatically uploading reviewed project documents to PMS3.0 according to predefined rules, reducing manual re-entry and operational errors.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"业务智能问答\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This is a proposed capability enabling users to query compliance issues throughout the project lifecycle, receiving AI-generated warnings or remediation suggestions based on stored knowledge.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"The State Grid Southwest Branch is the initiating and implementing organization for this project, responsible for its planning, development, and execution.\"<|>\"project sponsorship, organizational leadership\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"光明大模型\"<|>\"2025年基于大模型的生产技改大修项目档案合规智能审查微应用－开发项目\"<|>\"The Guangming Large Model serves as the foundational AI technology enabling the intelligent review functions of this project, particularly in document analysis and compliance checking.\"<|>\"core technology, enabling platform\"<|>9)##\n(\"relati