    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国网西南分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The State Grid Southwest Division is an organizational entity responsible for power dispatch and control operations in the southwest region, overseeing technical renovation projects and managing cloud-based operational systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西南电力设计院有限公司\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Southwest Electric Power Design Institute Co., Ltd. is a company contracted to conduct feasibility studies and assist in project reviews for technical renovation projects under the State Grid Southwest Division.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国网西南电力调控中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The State Grid Southwest Power Dispatch Control Center is a key operational unit within the State Grid Southwest Division, responsible for commissioning and managing technical renovation projects.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国分云西南站点基础平台\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Guofen Cloud Southwest Site Basic Platform is a foundational infrastructure component of the cloud-based system being developed for regulatory operations and management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"资源扩容改造\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Resource expansion and renovation refers to the upgrade and enhancement of existing IT infrastructure to support increased computational and storage demands.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"模型数据镜像节点建设\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Model data image node construction involves setting up dedicated nodes for storing and managing model data, supporting advanced data processing and analysis.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云可信验证功能建设\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Control cloud trusted verification function construction aims to implement security and integrity verification mechanisms within the cloud platform used for power dispatch operations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"关系数据库服务器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A server designated for managing relational databases, with two units specified in the equipment list.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"本地应用服务器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Servers used for hosting local applications, with three units required as per th