    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国分云西南站点\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"The Guofen Cloud Southwest Site is a regional node within the national control cloud platform, designed for model data mirroring and service delivery. It is subject to hardware configuration limitations due to space constraints in the automated data center.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云国分云平台及其应用建设规划方案讨论会会议纪要\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"This meeting minutes document outlines the planned typical configuration for the southwest site of the control cloud national and provincial platform, which was not fully implemented due to space constraints.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"模型镜像服务器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Model image servers are part of the hardware infrastructure at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with three units added in this phase, used for hosting virtualized models and supporting data synchronization.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"本地应用服务器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Local application servers are part of the hardware setup at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with three units added, responsible for running local applications and supporting services.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数据库服务器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Database servers are part of the hardware infrastructure at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with two units deployed, supporting data storage and synchronization functions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"磁盘阵列\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A disk array is a storage system installed as part of the hardware configuration at the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, providing centralized storage capacity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"SAN交换机\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"SAN switches are networking devices used in the storage area network of the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with two units installed to support high-speed data transfer.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"源端接入交换机\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Source-end access switches are networking devices used to connect source systems to the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with two units deployed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"高速资源同步网路由器\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A high-speed resource synchronization network router is a networking device facilitating fast data synchronization across sites, with one unit installed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"管理网交换机\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Management network switches are used for internal administrative communication within the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with two units deployed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟化接入交换机\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Virtualization access switches are used to connect virtualized computing resources within the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site, with two units installed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"全局负载均衡设备\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Global load balancing devices are used to distribute workloads efficiently across the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site’s infrastructure, with two units deployed.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"计算虚拟化24套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Computational virtualization licenses totaling 24 units are required for this phase, enabling CPU expansion on six physical servers (4 CPUs per server).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"云管理平台授权24套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Cloud management platform licenses totaling 24 units are required, corresponding to the number of compute servers and their virtualization needs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟机操作系统60套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Sixty virtual machine operating system licenses are needed, supporting 60 virtual machines created from 6 physical servers (10 VMs per server).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物理机操作系统2套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Two physical machine operating system licenses are required for the database servers and the combined model image and local application servers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"数据库及数据库同步软件1套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"One set of database and database synchronization software is required to enable data consistency between core nodes and mirror nodes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"多路径软件1套\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"One instance of multipath software is used to manage multiple data paths to the database servers, improving reliability and performance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公共资源软件\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Public resource software is a suite of middleware components including service bus, message bus, wide-area service proxy, permission management, task scheduling, system logging, real-time alerting, and basic services, specifically designed for the Guofen Cloud Southwest Site.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"模型镜像节点数据服务软件\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Model mirror node data service software is a specialized software package that provides functions such as public model service, primary model data service, secondary model service, model statistics service, display services, and interactive services, exclusively deployed at the mirror node.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"服务总线\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The service bus is a component of the public resource software that enables internal and wide-area service invocation, supporting SOA-based architecture and transparent RPC calls within and across sites.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"消息总线\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The message bus supports high-volume, low-latency message transmission across internal and wide-area networks, using event-driven mechanisms for reliable and timely information delivery.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"广域服务代理\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The wide-area service proxy facilitates secure and efficient cross-site service access by routing requests through a cluster of entry and exit proxies, enhancing security and availability.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"权限管理\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Permission management is a component of the public resource software that enables unified user authentication, role-based access control, and single sign-on across all applications and sites.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"任务调度\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Task scheduling is a system component that manages scheduled tasks with high availability and concurrency, allowing dynamic control over task execution and monitoring.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"系统日志\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"System logging is a foundational component for collecting, analyzing, and visualizing logs from various system