    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国网西南分部\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"State Grid Southwest Branch is a regional division responsible for power grid regulation and control operations in the southwest region of China. It oversees multiple technical renovation projects related to grid management, automation, cybersecurity, and renewable energy integration.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度运行处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Dispatching Operation Department is a functional unit within State Grid Southwest Branch responsible for operational dispatching activities and related system construction.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度计划处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Dispatching Planning Department is a functional unit responsible for load forecasting, scheduling planning, risk control, and market technical support systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"内水电及新能源处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Internal Hydropower and New Energy Department manages new energy power prediction, operation absorption monitoring, and evaluation systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"系统运行处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The System Operation Department handles monitoring and analysis systems for new energy storage and adjustable loads.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"继电保护处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Relay Protection Department is responsible for relay protection parameter online verification, equipment monitoring, and visualization application upgrades.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自动化处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Automation Department manages various automation systems including grid monitoring, data interface security, server upgrades, and multi-dimensional coordination platforms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"网络安全处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The Cybersecurity Department oversees network security management, multi-level blocking, risk monitoring, and application upgrades for secure operations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"综合处\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"The General Affairs Department manages integrated systems such as grid-source coordination and safety supervision platforms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"生产技改\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Production Technical Renovation refers to a category of project type involving infrastructure and system upgrades aimed at improving operational efficiency and technological capabilities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Regulation Cloud is a cloud platform used by State Grid Southwest Branch for supporting grid operation, data processing, and system integration across multiple departments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网运行关键指标后评估系统\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Post-Evaluation System for Key Grid Operation Indicators is a project aimed at assessing performance metrics after implementation, part of broader system improvement efforts.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电子沙盘显示大屏改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Electronic Sandtable Display Screen Upgrade is a project focused on upgrading the visual display system in the control center for improved situational awareness.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度自动化系统核心服务器改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Core Server Upgrade for the Dispatching Automation System involves modernizing critical computing infrastructure to enhance reliability and performance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"风光储接入调度主站技术支撑系统功能改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Functional Upgrade of the Wind-Solar-Storage Integration Technical Support System at the Dispatching Main Station enhances integration capabilities for renewable energy sources into the grid.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"继电保护定值在线校核预警系统改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Online Verification and Early Warning System Upgrade for Relay Protection Settings improves real-time accuracy and safety of protection parameters.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"继电保护设备在线监测国分互联及可视化应用提升改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Enhancement of Online Monitoring and Visualization for Relay Protection Equipment with National-Regional Interconnection improves transparency and operational oversight.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西南电力调峰辅助服务市场技术支撑系统功能改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Technical Support System Upgrade for the Southwest Power Peak-Shaving Auxiliary Service Market enables better market operation and grid flexibility.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"全周期多目标多约束调度计划风险管控平台建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Construction of a Full-Cycle, Multi-Objective, Multi-Constrained Scheduling Risk Management Platform aims to improve decision-making under complex constraints.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西南电网新能源功率预测及运行消纳监测考评系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Construction of a New Energy Power Forecasting, Operation Absorption Monitoring, and Evaluation System supports efficient integration of renewable energy into the grid.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新型储能及可调节负荷监祝分析系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Construction of a Monitoring and Analysis System for New Energy Storage and Adjustable Loads enhances grid flexibility and demand response capabilities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"基于电碳协同的电网低碳调度分析能力提升改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Improvement of Low-Carbon Grid Dispatching Analysis Based on Electric-Carbon Coordination focuses on reducing carbon emissions through optimized dispatching strategies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"攀西电网密集通道三维全景监视分析沙盘系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Construction of a 3D Panoramic Monitoring and Analysis Sandtable System for Dense Transmission Corridors in Panxi enhances visual monitoring and operational safety.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云国分云西南站点模型镜像节点建设及基础平台资源扩容改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Construction of Model Mirror Nodes for the Southwest Site of the Regulation Cloud and Expansion of Basic Platform Resources improves scalability and data redundancy.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云调度运行多维度会商系统建设\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Construction of a Multi-Dimensional Coordination System for Regulation Cloud Dispatching Operations supports collaborative decision-making across departments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控中心网络安全管理（CSM）应用改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The CSM Application Upgrade for Control Center Cybersecurity Enhances network security governance and compliance.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"监控系统网络安全多级阻断及安全三区数据接口风险监测功能改造\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The Upgrade of Multi-Level Blocking and Security Zone Data Interface Risk Monitoring Enhances cybersecurity resilience across network segments.