ified.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"云管理服务器1\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Cloud management server 1 is part of the cloud management infrastructure but no information about trusted verification software installation is provided.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"云管理服务器2\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Cloud management server 2 is part of the cloud management infrastructure but no information about trusted verification software installation is provided.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"云管理服务器3\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Cloud management server 3 is part of the cloud management infrastructure but no information about trusted verification software installation is provided.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可信验证管理中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The trusted verification management center is responsible for receiving audit logs and alerts from trusted verification modules, ensuring compliance with cybersecurity standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"网络安全管理平台\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The network security management platform is the centralized system that receives and processes audit and alert data from trusted verification nodes, especially when devices are offline and need to send delayed reports.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"物理隔离装置\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The physical isolation device is a security component used to separate network zones, ensuring secure data transmission between different security levels.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"交换机\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The switch is a networking device used within the system to facilitate communication between servers and other components.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"OMS\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"OMS refers to the Operational Management System, which is involved in monitoring and managing operational processes within the control cloud environment.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"监测装置\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The monitoring device is used for observing and detecting anomalies or security events within the system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西南分部调控云\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Southwest Branch Control Cloud refers to the regional control cloud system located in the southwest region, serving as a key infrastructure for power grid operations and cybersecurity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全II区\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Security Zone II is a designated security level within the power system's network architecture, indicating a specific tier of protection and access control.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全川区\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Security Zone III (possibly miswritten as 'Chuan') is another security zone in the network hierarchy, typically associated with internal control systems and higher-level security requirements.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调控云域\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Control Cloud Domain refers to the overall domain or network space encompassing all control cloud resources and services, including servers, databases, and management systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家密码主管部门\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The National Cryptography Administration is the regulatory body responsible for setting cryptographic standards in China, requiring compliance with national algorithms such as SM3.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国密SM3算法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"National Cryptography SM3 Algorithm is a cryptographic hash function standardized by China’s National Cryptography Administration, used for integrity verification in trusted computing systems.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可信根\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Trusted Root is a foundational component in trusted computing, providing secure cryptographic operations and storage. It can be implemented in hardware (as a board card) or software (using CPU-based computation).\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可信基准库\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Trusted Baseline Library stores expected values of programs, configurations, and files at trusted verification nodes. It is stored in non-volatile memory and protected against tampering.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可信审计\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Trusted Auditing involves recording and reporting results of trusted verification processes, including failures, policy changes, and node states, with support for delayed reporting when network connectivity is restored.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自保护功能\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Self-protection Functionality ensures that the trusted software base cannot be easily killed, disabled, or uninstalled, protecting it from malicious attacks.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"等保三级以上系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Systems classified at Level 3 or above under the Cybersecurity Law of China require advanced security measures, including dynamic measurement of all application execution stages.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"可信验证告警监视软件\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Trusted Verification Alert Monitoring Software is a component responsible for detecting, recording, and displaying alerts generated by the trusted verification process.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"硬件可信根\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Hardware Trusted Root is implemented via a computer board card with built-in cryptographic chips and storage hardware, enabling secure operations across CPU real mode, kernel, and application layers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"软件可信根\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Software Trusted Root uses CPU-based computation to implement cryptographic functions, allowing for flexible deployment while maintaining security.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器1\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 1 to perform integrity checks during boot and runtime.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器2\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 2 to verify system integrity and prevent unauthorized modifications.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器3\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 3 to ensure trusted execution of system and application components.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器4\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 4 to monitor and validate system and application integrity.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器5\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 5 to perform static and dynamic measurements of system components.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器6\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 6 to enforce trusted boot and runtime validation.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器7\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 7 to detect and block unauthorized changes to system files and configurations.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器8\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 8 to ensure trusted operation of applications and system programs.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器9\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 9 to provide integrity verification for both static and dynamic code execution.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器10\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 10 to maintain secure boot and runtime validation.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器11\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 11 to protect system integrity through cryptographic verification.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器12\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 12 to enforce trusted execution of applications and system components.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器13\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 13 to enable dynamic measurement of application execution.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器14\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 14 to support trusted verification across multiple system layers.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"虚拟化计算服务器15\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is installed on virtualized computing server 15 to ensure secure loading and execution of system and application components.\" <|>\"system integrity, software deployment\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"可信验证管理中心\"<|>\"The trusted verification software sends audit logs and alerts to the trusted verification management center for centralized monitoring and analysis.\" <|>\"data flow, centralized management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"网络安全管理平台\"<|>\"The trusted verification software transmits audit and alert information to the network security management platform, especially when network connection is restored after being offline.\" <|>\"compliance reporting, data synchronization\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"可信基准库\"<|>\"The trusted verification software generates and updates the trusted baseline library by collecting expected values of programs and configurations.\" <|>\"baseline creation, integrity verification\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"可信根\"<|>\"The trusted verification software relies on the trusted root to perform cryptographic operations and secure storage during system boot and runtime validation.\" <|>\"trusted computing, cryptographic foundation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信根\"<|>\"硬件可信根\"<|>\"The hardware trusted root provides secure cryptographic operations and storage, forming the physical basis for trusted verification.\" <|>\"hardware security, trusted foundation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信根\"<|>\"软件可信根\"<|>\"The software trusted root implements the same functions as the hardware version but uses CPU-based computation instead of dedicated hardware.\" <|>\"software implementation, trusted root\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信基准库\"<|>\"可信验证管理中心\"<|>\"The trusted baseline library is managed and monitored by the trusted verification management center, which ensures its integrity and availability.\" <|>\"data management, system integrity\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信审计\"<|>\"可信验证管理中心\"<|>\"The trusted auditing function sends audit records to the trusted verification management center for review and tracking.\" <|>\"audit reporting, compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信审计\"<|>\"网络安全管理平台\"<|>\"The trusted auditing system forwards audit and alert data to the network security management platform, particularly when devices reconnect after being offline.\" <|>\"compliance reporting, delayed transmission\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"等保三级以上系统\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"For systems classified at Level 3 or above, the trusted verification software must perform dynamic measurement of all application execution stages, including code and data segments.\" <|>\"regulatory compliance, enhanced security\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西南分部调控云\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is deployed within the Southwest Branch Control Cloud infrastructure to secure critical computing nodes and ensure system integrity.\" <|>\"infrastructure security, regional deployment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"安全II区\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software operates within Security Zone II, where it protects critical systems and enforces security policies.\" <|>\"security zone, access control\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"安全川区\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is implemented in Security Zone III (possibly referred to as 'Chuan'), supporting secure operations in high-risk environments.\" <|>\"security zone, secure operations\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"调控云域\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software is integrated into the entire control cloud domain, covering all servers and management systems.\" <|>\"system-wide integration, domain coverage\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家密码主管部门\"<|>\"国密SM3算法\"<|>\"The National Cryptography Administration mandates the use of the SM3 algorithm for cryptographic integrity verification in trusted computing systems.\" <|>\"regulation, standardization\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国密SM3算法\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software uses the SM3 algorithm to compute and verify file integrity values during trusted validation processes.\" <|>\"cryptographic verification, algorithm usage\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"自保护功能\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software includes self-protection features that prevent it from being killed, disabled, or uninstalled, ensuring continuous protection.\" <|>\"self-defense, anti-tampering\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"物理隔离装置\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software operates in conjunction with the physical isolation device to ensure secure communication between network zones.\" <|>\"network security, isolation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"交换机\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification software communicates with the switch to manage network traffic and ensure secure data flows between verified nodes.\" <|>\"network integration, data flow\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"OMS\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The OMS system interacts with the trusted verification software to monitor operational status and respond to security alerts.\" <|>\"operational management, system monitoring\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"监测装置\"<|>\"可信验证软件\"<|>\"The monitoring device detects anomalies and works with the trusted verification software to trigger alerts and initiate responses.\" <|>\"monitoring, threat detection\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"trusted computing, system integrity, cybersecurity, cryptographic verification, regulatory compliance, network security zones, software deployment, audit and logging, self-protection, regional control cloud\")<|COMPLETE|>"
