e only authorized method for updating the trusted baseline library, ensuring changes are made securely and verified.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"硬件形态的可信根\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Hardware-form trusted root is implemented as a computer board card with integrated cryptographic chips and storage hardware, providing hardware-level security for cryptographic operations and storage.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"软件形态的可信根\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Software-form trusted root uses CPU-based computation to perform cryptographic functions, offering a flexible alternative to hardware implementation while maintaining trustworthiness.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"动态度量\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Dynamic measurement involves real-time verification of program execution stages, including code segments, memory code segments, and read-only data segments, particularly required for systems classified at Level 3 or above.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度数字证书\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Scheduling digital certificate is used to sign business applications, ensuring software version consistency and source authenticity throughout development, testing, and deployment phases.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"公钥证书\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Public key certificate is used by the trusted verification module to validate software signatures from developers and testing institutions, blocking execution if validation fails.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"自保护能力\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Self-protection capability ensures the trusted software base cannot be killed, disabled, or uninstalled by malicious actors, maintaining continuous protection across all system layers.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"守护进程\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Guardian process is a background process within the trusted software base that prevents termination and maintains operational integrity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"防卸载\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Anti-uninstallation feature ensures the trusted verification module remains active even under attack attempts to remove it from the system.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"审计记录\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Audit record is a log entry created whenever a trusted verification check fails, capturing details such as the component involved, time, and nature of the deviation.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"补报\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Supplementary reporting refers to the mechanism by which audit and alert data generated while offline are transmitted once network connectivity is restored.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"策略变更信息\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Policy change information includes updates to verification rules or thresholds, which must be reported to the management platform according to specified standards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"等保三级以上系统\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Systems classified at Level 3 or higher under China’s Cybersecurity Law require comprehensive security measures, including full dynamic measurement of all application execution stages.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力监控系统网络安全管理平台应用功能规范（试行）\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"This document outlines the required formats and functionalities for reporting audit and alert data from trusted verification nodes to the central cybersecurity management platform.\")##\n\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"可信引导度量\"<|>\"The trusted verification module performs trusted boot measurement by validating critical boot files against expected values stored in the trusted baseline library.\" <|>\"integrity verification, boot security\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"可信验证告警监视软件\"<|>\"The trusted verification module generates alerts that are received and displayed by the trusted verification alert monitoring software for real-time visibility.\" <|>\"alert propagation, monitoring integration\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"算法调用接口\"<|>\"The trusted verification module uses the algorithm invocation interface to call cryptographic functions like SM3 for computing file integrity values.\" <|>\"cryptographic access, interface usage\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"可信根\"<|>\"The trusted verification module relies on the trusted root to perform secure cryptographic operations and storage during the verification process.\" <|>\"trusted foundation, cryptographic support\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"可信基准库\"<|>\"The trusted verification module retrieves expected values from the trusted baseline library to compare against actual system components during verification.\" <|>\"baseline comparison, integrity check\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"非易失性存储器\"<|>\"The trusted baseline library is stored in non-volatile memory, which the trusted verification module accesses to retrieve expected values securely.\" <|>\"data storage, secure retrieval\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"专用更新接口\"<|>\"The trusted verification module uses the specialized update interface to securely update the trusted baseline library when authorized.\" <|>\"secure update, policy enforcement\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"硬件形态的可信根\"<|>\"When implemented in hardware form, the trusted verification module interfaces with the hardware trusted root to leverage its secure cryptographic capabilities.\" <|>\"hardware integration, trusted root usage\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"软件形态的可信根\"<|>\"When implemented in software form, the trusted verification module uses CPU-based computation via the software trusted root to perform cryptographic tasks.\" <|>\"software implementation, trusted root usage\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"动态度量\"<|>\"For systems at Level 3 or above, the trusted verification module performs dynamic measurement of application execution stages, including code and data segments.\" <|>\"dynamic verification, compliance requirement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"调度数字证书\"<|>\"The trusted verification module validates software using scheduling digital certificates to ensure version consistency and origin authenticity.\" <|>\"software signing, identity verification\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"公钥证书\"<|>\"The trusted verification module imports public key certificates to verify software signatures; if invalid, it blocks execution.\" <|>\"signature validation, access control\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"自保护能力\"<|>\"The trusted verification module incorporates self-protection mechanisms to prevent being killed, disabled, or uninstalled by malicious processes.\" <|>\"self-defense, anti-tampering\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"守护进程\"<|>\"The trusted verification module includes a guardian process that runs continuously to monitor and protect the module's own operation.\" <|>\"process protection, self-monitoring\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"防卸载\"<|>\"The trusted verification module implements anti-uninstallation features to maintain its presence and functionality regardless of external attacks.\" <|>\"system persistence, anti-removal\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"审计记录\"<|>\"The trusted verification module creates audit records whenever a verification check fails, logging the event for further analysis.\" <|>\"audit generation, incident logging\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"补报\"<|>\"When disconnected from the network, the trusted verification module stores audit logs locally and sends them later via supplementary reporting upon reconnection.\" <|>\"offline data handling, delayed transmission\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"策略变更信息\"<|>\"The trusted verification module reports policy change events to the management platform to ensure centralized control and transparency.\" <|>\"policy synchronization, compliance reporting\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"等保三级以上系统\"<|>\"The trusted verification module supports dynamic measurement requirements mandated for systems classified at Level 3 or above.\" <|>\"regulatory compliance, enhanced security\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块\"<|>\"电力监控系统网络安全管理平台应用功能规范（试行）\"<|>\"The trusted verification module follows the specifications in this document when sending audit and alert d