search Institute submitted the review opinion report to the Southwest Branch of State Grid Corporation, indicating a formal reporting and supervisory relationship.\" <|>\"project review, institutional coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"中国电力工程顾问集团西南电力设计院有限公司\"<|>\"The Southwest Branch commissioned the design institute to prepare the preliminary design documents for the project, establishing a client-contractor relationship.\" <|>\"project design, engineering services\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"2024年1月18日项目评审会议\"<|>\"The Southwest Branch organized the review meeting on January 18, 2024, to assess the project’s preliminary design, showing direct leadership and administrative involvement.\" <|>\"project governance, decision-making process\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网四川省电力公司经济技术研究院\"<|>\"2024年1月18日项目评审会议\"<|>\"The Sichuan Economic Research Institute participated in the review meeting and later verified the revised design documents, indicating active involvement in the evaluation process.\" <|>\"technical review, quality assurance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"曾鉴\"<|>\"国网四川省电力公司经济技术研究院\"<|>\"曾 Jian is the signatory of the official document from the Sichuan Economic Research Institute, indicating his role as an authorized representative or official responsible for issuing the report.\" <|>\"document authority, institutional responsibility\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"芶继军\"<|>\"国网四川省电力公司经济技术研究院\"<|>\"Gou Jijun is listed as the contact person for the Sichuan Economic Research Institute, serving as the primary point of communication for inquiries related to the project.\" <|>\"project coordination, contact management\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"成都\"<|>\"2024年1月18日项目评审会议\"<|>\"The project review meeting was held in Chengdu, making it the geographical location for this key event.\" <|>\"location, event venue\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网西南分部调控云国分云西南站点模型数据镜像节点建设及基础平台资源扩容改造项目\"<|>\"国家电网有限公司西南分部\"<|>\"The project is managed and approved by the Southwest Branch of State Grid Corporation, which holds authority over its execution and funding.\" <|>\"project ownership, management responsibility\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网西南分部调控云国分云西南站点模型数据镜像节点建设及基础平台资源扩容改造项目\"<|>\"中国电力工程顾问集团西南电力设计院有限公司\"<|>\"The design institute prepared the preliminary design documents for this project, fulfilling the technical planning role.\" <|>\"design execution, technical documentation\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"power grid infrastructure, control cloud platform, project review, technical design, resource expansion, data mirroring, Southwest China\")<|COMPLETE|>"
