onal control and monitoring.\" <|>\"cloud governance, platform management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"虚拟机操作系统\"<|>\"新增60 套\"<|>\"These licenses are required to run 60 virtual machines, supporting diverse applications across the platform.\" <|>\"virtual machine deployment, OS licensing\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"公共资源软件包\"<|>\"新增1套\"<|>\"This software package supports critical functions like service bus and task scheduling for the model mirror node.\" <|>\"software integration, service layer\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"模型镜像节点数据服务软件\"<|>\"新增1套\"<|>\"This software enables data services for models, statistics, and user interaction, forming the core of the mirror node’s functionality.\" <|>\"data service, functional software\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证模块软件\"<|>\"新增18 套\"<|>\"Deployed across 18 virtual servers in Security Zone III to ensure runtime integrity and compliance.\" <|>\"security enforcement, trust verification\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证管理中心软件\"<|>\"新增1套\"<|>\"Centralizes trust management and coordinates verification processes across all nodes.\" <|>\"centralized control, trust management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可信验证管理中心硬件\"<|>\"新增1台\"<|>\"Provides physical infrastructure for the trust verification system, ensuring secure operation.\" <|>\"hardware foundation, trust infrastructure\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"网络安全监测装置\"<|>\"采集可信验证节点的审计告警信息\"<|>\"This device monitors and collects security-related data from trusted verification nodes, enabling real-time threat detection.\" <|>\"security monitoring, data collection\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"拆除设备处置意见\"<|>\"无拆除设备\"<|>\"The project does not involve any equipment removal, meaning no decommissioning or disposal procedures are needed.\" <|>\"no asset retirement, zero decommissioning\"<|>10)##\n\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"project budget, technical design, infrastructure expansion, cost optimization, software replacement, network redundancy, security verification, regulatory 